{%- comment -%}
  Shared across all layouts. The map is two stacked SVGs (static world basemap +
  today's country overlay); they share a viewBox, so contain-fitting both in one
  box registers them pixel-perfect. There is no Framework utility for layering
  images, so this is the one bit of custom CSS — kept out of inline style
  attributes per the Framework guidelines.
{%- endcomment -%}
<style>
  .ktw-map { position: relative; width: 100%; padding-top: 52%; }
  .ktw-map img { position: absolute; inset: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; }
</style>
